## Module Responsibilities

| File | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| `routers/convert.py` | Receive upload, call services in order, return file response |
| `services/llm_service.py` | Build multimodal prompt, call Claude API, return PNG bytes |
| `services/convertio_service.py` | Upload PNG to Convertio, poll for result, return `.ai` bytes |
| `schemas/convert.py` | Validate prompt input; define response shape |
| `core/config.py` | Load `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY`, `CONVERTIO_API_KEY` from environment |
| `utils/image.py` | Encode images to base64 for LLM payload construction |

## API

### `POST /convert`

**Request:** `multipart/form-data`

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `style_reference` | file | ✅ | Image whose style will be applied |
| `target_image` | file | ✅ | Image to be transformed |
| `prompt` | string | ✅ | Instructions to guide the transformation |

**Response:** `application/octet-stream`
- Binary `.ai` file download
- Header: `Content-Disposition: attachment; filename="output_<uuid>.ai"`

**Errors:**

| Status | Reason |
|---|---|
| `400` | Invalid file type, missing field, or malformed prompt |
| `422` | Pydantic validation failure |
| `502` | LLM API or Convertio API error |
| `504` | Convertio conversion timed out |

## Key Conventions
- Images are never written to disk — all processing is in-memory as bytes
- API keys are loaded exclusively from environment variables via `core/config.py`
- The router is thin — all pipeline logic lives in the services
- `llm_service` and `convertio_service` are stateless and independently testable
- Convertio polling has a configurable timeout with a `504` fallback
- File type validation (jpg/png only) happens at the router level before any service is called